# Boost on 22's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# HP refilled (party-level) and PP refilled (the four moves set again, as 20's boost gave them; auto_battle picks
# between them by type).
# For the Route 214/213 trainers and TRAINER_RIVAL_PASTORIA_CITY_TURTWIG (STARAVIA 34, BUIZEL 32, ROSELIA 32,
# MONFERNO 36: Rock Slide on Staravia, Seed Bomb on Buizel, Earthquake on Monferno).
party-level 0 58
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-move 0 3 MOVE_ROCK_SLIDE
